base_view: neondb_telemetry__attempt
label: Sealed telemetry (test)
description: >-
  Sealed test attempts (three repetitions per condition) with telemetry only:
  latency, tokens, failure classes, tool and query counts. No per-attempt
  correctness exists for this partition; use the Sealed aggregate topic for the
  published rates.
fields:
- neondb_telemetry__attempt.*
- neondb_telemetry__question.*
- neondb_telemetry__run.*
joins:
  neondb_telemetry__question: {}
  neondb_telemetry__run: {}
default_filters:
  neondb_telemetry__attempt.partition:
    is: test
ai_context: >-
  Correctness measures are not available here by design. Compare arms on
  median_latency_ms, refused_or_error_rate, terminal_failure_class and token
  totals only.
